 and (2) identify in-demand occupations that lack the use of apprenticeships, analyze the use of the qualified apprenticeship program model in those occupations, and report on such analysis to states and Congress.</p>","updateDate":"2026-06-05T20:43:38Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"American Apprenticeship Act","type":"hr","updateDate":"2026-09-25T08:06:31Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-09-25T08:06:31Z"}
